:"2025-08-24T15:52:31Z","updated_at":"2025-08-24T15:52:31Z","body":"Oh dear! I'm sorry that I didn't notice that. ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3218201879/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3218234880","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108768#issuecomment-3218234880","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108768","id":3218234880,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6_0l4A","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-24T16:53:00Z","updated_at":"2025-08-24T16:53:00Z","body":"Seems to be caused by the way it handles threads and count, where it calls from `main.cpp` with `0` for argument in thread-less builds:\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/73da0d20207f751cb8d1ec7922613b39dfc46b12/main/main.cpp#L1950-L1962\r\n\r\nWhich checks with this:\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/73da0d20207f751cb8d1ec7922613b39dfc46b12/core/object/worker_thread_pool.cpp#L826-L828\r\n\r\nUsing this:\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/73da0d20207f751cb8d1ec7922613b39dfc46b12/platform/web/os_web.cpp#L151-L157\r\n\r\nSo it went from taking `0` to `1`, so this probably just exposed a bug elsewhere, but this changes the behavior with no threads in `main.cpp`, unsure what the specific issues might be, but this is the specific trigger for it\r\n\r\nI will look into it more tomorrow and make a report","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3218234880/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3218251249","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108768#issuecomment-3218251249","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108768","id":3218251249,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6_0p3x","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","recei