 of some weird interactions with:\r\n* https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104458\r\n\r\nI think this might be a bit tricky to fix without creating unexpected effects elsewhere, so I'd suggest reverting this and coordinating with @marcosc90 for a proper fix we can test during 4.6\r\n\r\nIt *could* be enough to change:\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/73da0d20207f751cb8d1ec7922613b39dfc46b12/platform/web/os_web.cpp#L151-L157\r\n\r\nInto:\r\n```cpp\r\nint OS_Web::get_default_thread_pool_size() const { \r\n#ifdef THREADS_ENABLED \r\n\treturn godot_js_os_thread_pool_size_get(); \r\n#else // No threads. \r\n\treturn 0; \r\n#endif \r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nBut can't speak to possible other impacts of that","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3224601270/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3224915199","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108768#issuecomment-3224915199","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108768","id":3224915199,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7AOEz_","user":{"login":"WinnerWind","id":71366717,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxMzY2NzE3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71366717?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WinnerWind","html_url":"https://github.com/WinnerWind","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WinnerWind/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WinnerWind/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WinnerWind/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WinnerWind/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WinnerWind/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WinnerWind/orgs","repos_url":"